# Place your Dune saga PDFs in this folder.

# PDFS/ is gitignored (the old copyrighted PDFs were untracked from the
# repository), but the folder ships with the repo so a fresh clone has a
# ready-made place for your books.

# After adding PDFs here, either point `[library] paths` at this folder
# (`~/.config/dune/config.toml`) and run `dune index`, or index them
# directly without touching the config:
#
#   dune index --file PDFS/*.pdf